WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.501 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Last time you were here
on the show,

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:04.270
we played charades and we won
'cause we were a great team.

00:00:04.270 --> 00:00:05.672 align:start size:94% position:6%
-We really won. We kicked ass.
-Yes.

00:00:05.672 --> 00:00:08.074 align:start size:94% position:6%
I thought maybe really quickly
if you don't mind,

00:00:08.074 --> 00:00:09.776 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'd love to play
a new game with you.

00:00:09.776 --> 00:00:10.610 line:92%
-I would love to play a game.

00:00:10.610 --> 00:00:13.646 align:start size:94% position:6%
-All right, this one is called
the Jinx Challenge.

00:00:13.646 --> 00:00:17.117 align:start size:94% position:6%
♪♪ -J-J-Jinx,
J-J-J-Jinx Challenge ♪♪

00:00:17.117 --> 00:00:19.719 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Now here, you put your hand
in this glove here.

00:00:19.719 --> 00:00:20.687 line:92%
-Okay. Got you. I got you.

00:00:20.687 --> 00:00:22.622 align:start size:94% position:6%
-No problem. Here we go.
All right.

00:00:22.622 --> 00:00:23.289 size:88% position:44% line:92%
Here we go. So now look.

00:00:23.289 --> 00:00:25.091 align:start size:94% position:6%
Here we are.
We're connected, right?

00:00:25.091 --> 00:00:26.493 line:92%
-We're connected. We are one.

00:00:26.493 --> 00:00:27.093 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yes, we are one.

00:00:27.093 --> 00:00:29.362
There's no real reason that
we're wearing these gloves,

00:00:29.362 --> 00:00:30.063 size:75% position:38% line:92%
but it's fun for me.

00:00:30.063 --> 00:00:31.531 size:81% position:41%
It's very fashionable.
-Here's how it works.

00:00:31.531 --> 00:00:33.333 align:start size:94% position:6%
What we do is we read
a category from this card

00:00:33.333 --> 00:00:34.034 size:75% position:38% line:92%
then count to three,

00:00:34.034 --> 00:00:37.871
and then both say something in
that category at the same time.

00:00:37.871 --> 00:00:38.304 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Okay.

00:00:38.304 --> 00:00:40.473 align:start size:94% position:6%
-All right? When we say
the same thing, it is a jinx.

00:00:40.473 --> 00:00:41.441 size:81% position:41% line:92%
And let's have a goal.

00:00:41.441 --> 00:00:42.442 line:92%
Let's try to get two jinxes.

00:00:42.442 --> 00:00:44.544 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Okay. We can do
better than that. Come on.

00:00:44.544 --> 00:00:46.413 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Three jinxes?
-Yes. Let's do this.

00:00:46.413 --> 00:00:47.480 align:start size:94% position:6%
Let's get this going.
-Really?

00:00:47.480 --> 00:00:50.583
-Come on. We're connected.
-All right, here we go, pal.

00:00:50.583 --> 00:00:53.820 align:start size:94% position:6%
Ready?
-Let's do it.

00:00:53.820 --> 00:00:55.555 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Fashion magazines.

00:00:55.555 --> 00:00:57.190 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
One, two, three.

00:00:57.190 --> 00:00:57.657 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Vogue.

00:00:57.657 --> 00:01:00.760 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Wow. Come on.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:00.760 --> 00:01:03.496 align:start size:94% position:6%
Ready?
-Okay.

00:01:03.496 --> 00:01:04.731 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Body parts.

00:01:04.731 --> 00:01:06.332 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
One, two, three.

00:01:06.332 --> 00:01:06.766 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Legs.

00:01:06.766 --> 00:01:10.437 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Wow!
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:10.437 --> 00:01:13.139 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Three, that's it, come on.
-Apps.

00:01:13.139 --> 00:01:14.574 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
One, two, three.

00:01:14.574 --> 00:01:15.241 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Instagram.

00:01:15.241 --> 00:01:17.110 line:92%
Oh, my God! Come on! Dude!

00:01:17.110 --> 00:01:18.678 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:18.678 --> 00:01:19.846 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
You're fantastic.

00:01:19.846 --> 00:01:22.515 align:start size:94% position:6%
Karlie Kloss, everybody.
We did not plan that.

00:01:22.515 --> 00:01:24.184 align:start size:94% position:6%
The new season of
"Project Runway"

00:01:24.184 --> 00:01:28.154 align:start size:94% position:6%
